{
  "name": "dsh-turn-process-open",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "把已结束轮次的中间过程（“已完成，用时 …”）锁定为展开：通过 React fiber 取到上游 Chat 的 setTurnProcessOpen，向 per-session store 预写展开记录，使新消息 / 自动收起不再折叠整轮；过程组仍按上游默认折叠、可正常开合。另挂 ⌘⌥. / Ctrl+Alt+. 折叠当前会话已展开的工作步骤、把最新一轮封口成历史轮次的组头形态，并按阅读线保持阅读位置。",
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./index.ts"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsdown",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "check:css": "node check-css.mjs",
    "check": "node --check lib/client.js && node --check index.ts",
    "test": "node test/run-all.mjs"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "~4.0.6-alpha.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-shortcuts": "^0.2.2-alpha.2",
    "tsdown": "^0.22.2",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3"
  }
}
